    delphi:hasVerdict "resolvable-now" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.95"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The historical alternatives have direct genomic predictions and broad public sampling. Standard phylogenomics and ancestry inference can resolve the claim with high power." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compare whole genomes of diverse domestic pigeon breeds with Columba livia subspecies and other candidate wild stocks using phylogenetic and admixture models. Nesting of all breeds within rock-pigeon diversity supports the claim; a distinct ancestral contribution would refute it." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Some geographic wild populations remain undersampled.", "Recent introgression must be distinguished from primary ancestry." ;
